WEBVTT

00:01.550 --> 00:06.400
Armin, I'm glad I could
be a good person for you.

00:07.280 --> 00:09.900
You've won your bet.

00:10.960 --> 00:15.620
But this is where my gamble begins!

00:32.760 --> 00:36.150
We've identified the person likely
to be the female-form Titan.

00:37.460 --> 00:38.810
Her name is...

00:39.440 --> 00:40.650
Annie!

00:50.730 --> 00:52.010
O, my friend!

00:52.010 --> 00:54.610
This is a victory for us!

00:54.670 --> 00:57.770
Our fame starts here!

00:57.810 --> 00:58.770
O, my friend!

00:58.770 --> 01:04.070
Let us celebrate this victory
for the next battle!

01:18.710 --> 01:24.250
"I died for naught" — I won't
let it end like that for you

01:24.250 --> 01:29.510
until I am the last one standing

01:29.510 --> 01:32.490
The enemy is cruel... We will kill...

01:32.490 --> 01:35.530
The enemy is colossal... We will jump...

01:35.530 --> 01:39.170
In our hands we hold blades of glory

01:39.170 --> 01:41.450
and sing in the name of victory

01:41.450 --> 01:46.090
We bear the wings of freedom on our backs

01:47.410 --> 01:53.530
Swearing iron determination upon our hearts,

01:53.550 --> 01:58.070
we slash apart the circle of idiocy

01:59.650 --> 02:01.970
and soar through the sky

02:02.030 --> 02:06.230
with our wings of freedom

02:20.090 --> 02:25.140
Mercy: Assault on Stohess, Part 2

02:26.830 --> 02:29.140
A few days earlier

02:30.410 --> 02:32.040
They're late.

02:32.040 --> 02:35.650
Erwin and his damn folk are making me wait.

02:36.120 --> 02:40.100
Our Military Police escorts
are gonna arrive first.

02:41.790 --> 02:46.600
Maybe he's constipated again.

02:49.840 --> 02:52.990
You're quite talkative today, Captain.

02:52.990 --> 02:54.150
Cut me some slack.

02:54.440 --> 02:56.920
Talkativeness is in my personality.

03:05.960 --> 03:07.790
I'm sorry.

03:07.790 --> 03:12.920
It was all my fault. If only
I'd made the right decision...

03:14.500 --> 03:18.600
I told you. No one could
have foreseen the outcome.

03:21.620 --> 03:23.370
Sorry for being late.

03:23.370 --> 03:24.510
Not at all.

03:25.710 --> 03:26.940
You guys...

03:28.550 --> 03:30.410
Excuse me...

03:30.410 --> 03:33.310
We've identified the person likely
to be the female-form Titan.

03:34.840 --> 03:36.940
This time we will catch her.

03:41.590 --> 03:43.950
The operation will begin
the day after tomorrow.

03:43.950 --> 03:49.040
The location is Stohess, where we'll be
passing en route to the royal court.

03:49.360 --> 03:51.980
This is our one and only chance.

03:52.330 --> 03:56.350
If we can't escape there, you'll inevitably
fall into the hands of the authorities.

03:56.350 --> 03:59.840
Then it'll be even harder to pursue
those who scheme to destroy the Walls.

04:00.760 --> 04:04.620
Mankind's annihilation will
become even more imminent.

04:05.310 --> 04:07.760
We must bet everything we
have on this operation.

04:09.270 --> 04:11.020
The plan is at follows:

04:11.930 --> 04:13.840
While we're passing through Stohess,

04:13.840 --> 04:17.770
Eren, you'll act as bait to
lure the target to this tunnel.

04:18.100 --> 04:20.050
If you can bring her into its depths,

04:20.050 --> 04:26.090
then even if she transforms, she won't
have the space to utilize her power.

04:26.660 --> 04:29.830
But if by any chance she
transforms before then,

04:29.830 --> 04:32.380
we'll have to rely on you, Eren.

04:32.940 --> 04:38.540
Yes, sir. Are we certain
our target is in Stohess?

04:38.740 --> 04:41.760
Yes. She's in the Police.

04:42.110 --> 04:43.680
The Police?

04:43.680 --> 04:45.480
Armin figured it all out.

04:46.520 --> 04:51.310
She's also suspected of killing
those two captive Titans.

04:52.210 --> 04:56.230
She might be your former
fellow cadet from the 104th.

04:57.310 --> 05:01.400
Hold on now! The 104th?!

05:01.760 --> 05:05.730
The name of the woman suspected
to be the female-form is...

05:05.730 --> 05:07.290
Wait...

05:13.390 --> 05:16.310
Annie Leonhardt.

05:27.930 --> 05:28.840
Shit!

05:35.520 --> 05:41.360
Damn! The way she was acting... She
must've seen through me right away!

05:41.360 --> 05:44.030
She knew we were gonna ambush her underground!

05:44.030 --> 05:47.030
There must've been some other way!

05:47.420 --> 05:49.780
You'll have time to think about that later.

05:49.780 --> 05:52.170
What should we do now?

05:53.560 --> 05:57.280
First of all, we need to rendezvous
with Team 3 on the surface

05:57.280 --> 06:01.790
then according to the backup plan,
fight Annie... the female-form Titan.

06:02.420 --> 06:06.960
Eren, you'll have to transform
and assist with her capture.

06:06.960 --> 06:08.310
That okay?

06:08.310 --> 06:09.180
Yeah.

06:09.760 --> 06:11.080
Hey!

06:11.800 --> 06:13.060
It's Team 3!

06:13.240 --> 06:15.560
Did your capture attempt fail?

06:15.560 --> 06:17.430
It did!

06:17.430 --> 06:19.940
Move on to the next sta...

06:30.160 --> 06:31.810
She kicked it in?!

06:34.630 --> 06:35.700
We have to help them!

06:35.700 --> 06:37.580
Eren! Back!

06:37.940 --> 06:40.250
Hey, Mikasa!

06:41.100 --> 06:44.690
That bitch wouldn't mind killing Eren?

06:45.240 --> 06:46.350
She risked it...

06:47.890 --> 06:51.410
She smashed open the tunnel
hoping she wouldn't kill you.

06:51.410 --> 06:53.600
It's crazy, but that just
makes her even scarier!

06:55.930 --> 06:59.600
Annie will be trying as hard
as she can to catch you!

07:04.360 --> 07:07.530
What should we do? She cut off our escape.

07:07.530 --> 07:09.800
Even if we jumped out using our gear,

07:09.800 --> 07:11.490
she'd ambush us the instant we surfaced.

07:11.690 --> 07:12.900
On the other hand,

07:17.110 --> 07:21.030
if we stay here it's just a matter
of time until we're crushed.

07:22.120 --> 07:23.940
I'll handle this!

07:23.940 --> 07:26.460
Like that time with the cannonball!

07:29.130 --> 07:30.360
Come here!

07:31.100 --> 07:32.270
Let's do this!

07:32.270 --> 07:33.550
Stay close to me!

07:44.940 --> 07:48.400
Not again! Why now?!

07:53.340 --> 07:55.660
Why now?! It hurts!

07:57.960 --> 08:02.260
So you can't transform unless it's
for a specific, concrete reason?

08:02.260 --> 08:04.420
Clear your mind! Focus on it again!

08:04.420 --> 08:07.170
I'm trying!

08:14.250 --> 08:15.140
Aren't you really

08:16.900 --> 08:20.850
just hesitating to fight Annie?

08:23.720 --> 08:24.650
Eren?

08:25.480 --> 08:28.400
Don't tell me that you still

08:28.400 --> 08:32.110
refuse to accept that she's the female-form?

08:34.030 --> 08:37.730
What just happened right before your eyes?

08:37.730 --> 08:42.360
That bitch killed your comrades!
You still refuse to accept that?

08:44.870 --> 08:48.340
Shut up! You're not helping!

08:51.280 --> 08:53.630
Annie's the female-form Titan?

08:54.250 --> 08:58.150
Why? Why would you say that, Armin?

08:59.020 --> 09:02.770
She knew your face from the beginning.

09:03.270 --> 09:06.650
Not to mention, she reacted when I referred
to how you "sought to die so soon,"

09:06.970 --> 09:09.570
which nobody outside the
104th would understand.

09:09.940 --> 09:14.160
And mostly because I'm pretty
sure she killed Sawney and Bean,

09:14.180 --> 09:16.260
the two experimental subjects.

09:17.880 --> 09:20.200
But why?

09:20.200 --> 09:24.240
One would need quite the
skill to kill those two.

09:24.240 --> 09:26.360
The culprit would've used
their own 3D Maneuver Gear,

09:26.380 --> 09:27.720
since they'd be
accustomed to it.

09:28.640 --> 09:33.380
So that's why we had a gear check?
But Annie wasn't caught.

09:33.380 --> 09:36.590
Because she brought Marco's to the check.

09:37.450 --> 09:40.180
That's how she passed.

09:42.650 --> 09:47.020
What? What does Marco have to do with this?

09:47.820 --> 09:49.270
I don't know.

09:49.900 --> 09:51.560
Are you sure you're not mistaken?

09:51.560 --> 09:54.000
No, I'm pretty certain.

09:54.000 --> 09:58.780
I got that, kid. Do you
have any other evidence?

09:59.030 --> 10:00.770
I don't.

10:00.770 --> 10:04.370
In my opinion, the
female-form resembles Annie.

10:04.370 --> 10:06.290
What? What are you even saying?!

10:06.600 --> 10:08.190
Is that all you...

10:08.190 --> 10:10.630
So we've got no proof, but we'll still do it.

10:11.190 --> 10:13.220
No proof?

10:13.220 --> 10:15.980
What? Then why?

10:15.980 --> 10:18.070
What if it isn't Annie?

10:18.070 --> 10:21.490
If it's not Annie, then she'll
be cleared of suspicion.

10:22.170 --> 10:25.240
True, we'll have put her
through a terrible ordeal.

10:25.240 --> 10:31.520
But if we do nothing, you'll be
sacrificed to Central's whims.

10:32.210 --> 10:34.940
It's just not right to doubt Annie..

10:34.940 --> 10:39.280
Eren, after hearing that it might be
Annie, has anything come to mind?

10:48.360 --> 10:51.250
You fought the female-form
in hand-to-hand combat.

10:51.510 --> 10:54.910
Did she use any of Annie's typical moves?

11:12.860 --> 11:20.770
You know it too. Annie is
the female-form Titan.

11:24.630 --> 11:27.810
So why aren't you fighting?

11:29.000 --> 11:33.920
Are other feelings holding you back?

11:33.920 --> 11:35.340
What?!

11:40.100 --> 11:41.630
I've got a plan!

11:42.850 --> 11:46.890
Mikasa and I will exit that hole
and the entrance at the same time.

11:47.090 --> 11:49.640
Annie will have to follow one of us.

11:50.020 --> 11:53.150
That should buy you time to run the other way!

11:53.460 --> 11:55.070
Wait!

11:55.070 --> 11:57.800
That means one of you is going to die!

11:57.800 --> 11:59.940
If we keep sitting here,
it'll be all three of us!

12:00.700 --> 12:02.640
Mikasa! On my mark!

12:02.640 --> 12:03.420
Okay!

12:03.420 --> 12:04.820
I'll go that way!

12:06.360 --> 12:08.020
Mikasa!

12:08.020 --> 12:09.040
Armin!

12:09.960 --> 12:11.330
How?

12:11.690 --> 12:14.440
How can you fight?!

12:14.440 --> 12:16.040
How?!

12:20.350 --> 12:21.920
We've got no choice.

12:23.080 --> 12:25.290
It's a cruel world out there.

12:58.680 --> 12:59.950
Eren!

13:15.670 --> 13:19.400
Annie! I'm not letting you have Eren!

13:20.660 --> 13:21.860
Eren!

13:23.170 --> 13:25.970
Eren! I'm going for you!

13:29.570 --> 13:31.350
Eren! Wake up!

13:56.010 --> 13:58.140
Don't let the female-form get away!

13:58.140 --> 14:01.230
We can't let her out of here!

14:06.820 --> 14:08.320
What's going on?!

14:08.680 --> 14:12.130
Backup team! Leave this to us!
Go check it out!

14:12.130 --> 14:13.450
Yes, sir!

14:15.040 --> 14:16.810
This is weird.

14:16.810 --> 14:19.500
That explosion and...

14:19.500 --> 14:20.490
Nile!

14:20.920 --> 14:23.340
Dispatch all of your soldiers.

14:23.340 --> 14:25.870
It's probably a Titan.

14:25.870 --> 14:27.300
What are you saying?

14:27.300 --> 14:32.270
This is Wall Sina! There can't
possibly be Titans in here!

14:33.130 --> 14:35.020
Stop! Don't move, Jaeger!

14:35.020 --> 14:37.680
I've tired of playing dress-up!

14:38.900 --> 14:42.190
Never call me that again, asshole!

14:42.550 --> 14:44.990
Commander, I'll go as well.

14:44.990 --> 14:47.110
Get your gear from Team 4.

14:47.110 --> 14:48.110
Yes, sir.

14:48.110 --> 14:52.380
Having a fiery spirit is good, but
don't forget how to stay alive.

14:52.380 --> 14:53.160
Yes, sir.

14:55.940 --> 14:58.200
Erwin, what...

14:58.200 --> 14:59.920
Commander, here!

15:01.630 --> 15:02.960
Thank you.

15:05.500 --> 15:07.050
Hey, Erwin...

15:07.990 --> 15:10.480
All that can move, mobilize!

15:10.480 --> 15:12.650
We must assist with the
capture of the female-form!

15:14.020 --> 15:16.010
Erwin, stop!

15:18.500 --> 15:22.980
What you're doing is a clear
rebellion against the King!

15:23.500 --> 15:24.850
No.

15:24.850 --> 15:28.320
Is your head as hollow as that gun barrel?

15:28.890 --> 15:31.820
You haven't a clue what's
going on, by the looks of it.

15:31.820 --> 15:34.370
Dismantle your gear, Erwin!

15:36.670 --> 15:38.450
A Titan! There's a Titan!

15:38.450 --> 15:40.870
How did it get here?!

15:41.800 --> 15:44.660
Dude... That's a Titan.

15:44.660 --> 15:46.210
But how?

15:46.210 --> 15:47.500
Outta my way!

15:49.580 --> 15:52.260
Just stay standing, dammit!

15:52.710 --> 15:56.260
I wanted to be one of them.

15:56.260 --> 15:59.100
What about now?

15:59.100 --> 16:00.230
Shit!

16:01.890 --> 16:03.730
Don't even try taking it down!

16:03.730 --> 16:05.610
It'll be enough if we can just hold it back!

16:17.060 --> 16:20.540
It's hopeless! It can see right through
the movements of the 3D Maneuver Gear!

16:24.420 --> 16:27.750
You won't get rid of me so easily!

16:35.060 --> 16:38.390
Eren! Answer me! Eren!

16:38.390 --> 16:40.270
What are you doing?!

16:40.270 --> 16:42.310
Jean! Eren's under here!

16:42.310 --> 16:45.310
What?! Wasn't he supposed
to transform into a Titan?

16:45.710 --> 16:47.310
He couldn't!

16:47.310 --> 16:51.440
Probably because the female-form
was actually Annie.

16:51.440 --> 16:52.190
What?!

16:52.820 --> 16:54.990
We have to get him out!

16:54.990 --> 16:57.240
Help, Jean!

16:57.910 --> 16:59.490
He couldn't?!

17:01.520 --> 17:03.750
What the fuck were you thinking, Eren?!

17:04.150 --> 17:07.250
I told you we'd all be counting on you!

17:07.250 --> 17:14.800
Is this our payback for placing mankind's
future and our very survival in your hands?!

17:15.550 --> 17:18.330
Marco... Marco...

17:29.510 --> 17:30.640
Eren?

17:31.190 --> 17:34.650
Shit! We've gotta bitchslap that skank first!

17:38.130 --> 17:42.480
Eren, remember what you told Jean before?

17:43.430 --> 17:48.770
You can't change anything unless you
can discard part of yourself too.

17:49.510 --> 17:54.240
To surpass monsters, you must be
willing to abandon your humanity.

17:54.780 --> 17:57.550
Annie can do that, I bet.

17:58.550 --> 18:00.840
I don't know what her goal is, though.

18:02.430 --> 18:04.830
But whoever can pull it off, wins!

18:18.260 --> 18:19.360
Annie!

18:20.300 --> 18:22.240
If you don't kill me now,

18:22.610 --> 18:26.080
next time you won't have
time to place your bet!

18:31.830 --> 18:33.210
Armin, this way!

18:33.210 --> 18:34.510
Roger!

18:44.870 --> 18:46.620
Coming... She's coming...

18:46.620 --> 18:50.440
Squad Leader, your eyes
are glowing maniacally.

19:21.480 --> 19:27.390
Okay! I didn't think we'd need another
backup plan, but you're just insane.

19:27.390 --> 19:30.570
Commander Erwin is quite the guy.

19:33.020 --> 19:34.340
Now then...

19:38.560 --> 19:41.820
Be a good girl for me, will you?

19:45.500 --> 19:51.380
You can't summon other Titans
to eat you either this time.

19:53.750 --> 19:59.600
But don't worry... I'm going
to devour you instead.

19:59.600 --> 20:02.970
I'll make sure to digest every
bit of intel I get from you.

20:08.500 --> 20:09.940
She broke free?!

20:10.580 --> 20:12.770
There weren't enough traps?!

20:13.500 --> 20:15.190
Don't let her escape!

20:21.730 --> 20:28.550
You can't change anything unless you
can discard part of yourself too.

20:30.010 --> 20:31.640
I know.

20:31.640 --> 20:38.540
My friends are out there.
I can't fail them now.

20:40.050 --> 20:40.920
Remember...

20:54.130 --> 20:57.660
I'll annihilate her.

20:57.660 --> 21:00.900
No... I'll kill her!

21:04.700 --> 21:08.910
I don't have time to worry
if it's right or wrong.

21:08.910 --> 21:12.910
You can't hope for a horror
story with a happy ending!

21:14.040 --> 21:15.580
Yeah!

21:15.580 --> 21:16.750
Mikasa!

21:17.500 --> 21:20.120
It's a cruel world out there.

21:29.430 --> 21:31.370
What is it this time?!

22:07.130 --> 22:08.270
Eren!

22:09.630 --> 22:11.050
Eren?

22:36.200 --> 22:41.590
If we suppose that I am not me,

22:41.590 --> 22:46.130
Can you say with certainty that you are you?

22:46.780 --> 22:51.660
Will you be able to pick up after yourself

22:51.660 --> 22:56.810
Once your sand-like shell breaks and your heart crumbles?

22:57.090 --> 23:02.020
I could hear someone calling

23:02.310 --> 23:05.920
But now my ears are just ringing

23:06.240 --> 23:11.080
It's as if time has frozen

23:11.380 --> 23:13.990
Now, wake up

23:13.990 --> 23:18.960
I began to walk through a deep dark abyss

23:19.510 --> 23:24.260
As swift as a gale, I escaped for my life

23:24.670 --> 23:28.830
I felt like a living corpse

23:29.240 --> 23:33.960
We break out of our walls

23:34.270 --> 23:40.350
To reunite in worlds we've yet to map

23:53.200 --> 23:57.111
"I'll exterminate the Titans from this world, not sparing a single one."

23:58.088 --> 24:03.088
The rage that pushed the young Eren to swear so on that day drives him on.

24:03.844 --> 24:05.066
On a path to destroy everything in the world.

24:05.066 --> 24:06.088
Wall: Assault on Stohess, Part 3
On a path to destroy everything in the world.

24:06.088 --> 24:06.966
Wall: Assault on Stohess, Part 3
